# demo.tape
Output demo.gif

Set Width 1800
Set Height 900
Set FontSize 13
Set Padding 15

Set Theme "Catppuccin Macchiato"
Set TypingSpeed 50ms

Hide
Type "./target/release/gitlab-tracker --demo"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Show

Down
Sleep 800ms
Down
Sleep 800ms

Type "s"
Sleep 1.5s
Type "s"
Sleep 1.5s
Type "S"
Sleep 1.5s

Sleep 2
